# Content conventions

- Follow `.cursor/skills/platformatory-content/SKILL.md` when creating or rewriting these files.
- Case studies: anonymous `customer_label`; no customer logos; no invented metrics.
- Case study `tags:` = outcome vocabulary; `technologies:` = product names only.
- Voice: plain practitioner prose—avoid AI antithesis stacks and brochure padding.
- Events: nest `talks:` keys under each list item; YouTube `video` is ID-only.
